WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.402
You know the moment. Someone says: we should all get together.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.306
Then the group chat begins. Numbers added one by one, photos lost in the scroll,

00:00:13.306 --> 00:00:15.397
plans buried under replies.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.746
Meet Popkin. A private space for your people, popped up in seconds, and free.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.833
Hold up the QR code. Friends scan it, add their name, and they're in. No app to

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:29.684
download.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.564
Chat with everyone. React, reply, or slip into a direct message.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.131
Every photo lands in one shared album, by the day, from everyone.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.027
Can't all be in one place? One tap, and the whole group is on a call.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.220
Share what you did, and what you're keen to do next. Rate it together, and see the

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.241
group's score.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.520
And when it's over, it doesn't just fade out. You get a proper send-off: a recap,

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:14.997
the best moment, and the album to keep.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.415
Free. Like, actually free. No ads, no premium tier.

00:01:21.615 --> 00:01:24.656
It works in the browser, on a phone or a desktop.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.644
Popkin. Your people, popped up in seconds. Start one tonight.
